OL,3,ATourist found guilty after stealing Las
OL,4,AVegas flamingo from enclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Canadian man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fanimal cruelty after he took a flamingo
OL,8,Ffrom its enclosure in Las Vegas and
OL,9,Fbrought it back to his hotel room
OL,10,Fduring an alcohol-fuelled bender.
OL,12,FMitchell Fairbarn, who was visiting the
OL,13,FUS city, took the Chilean flamingo
OL,14,Fnamed Peachy from the Flamingo Las
OL,15,FVegas Hotel and Casino in March.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
