OL,3,ATourist found guilty after stealing Las
OL,4,AVegas flamingo from enclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideos shown at his trial showed a
OL,7,Fsmiling Fairbarn carrying the bird by
OL,8,Fthe neck as he took a lift to his room.
OL,9,FHe testified that he had drunk 30 to 40
OL,10,Fbeers before the incident and said he
OL,11,Fnever meant to harm the animal. He
OL,12,Ffaces nearly five years in prison.
OL,14,FAnimal experts testified the flamingo
OL,15,Fhad feathers torn out and suffered
OL,16,Fblood loss due to Fairbarn's actions.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
